#. TRANSLATORS: a space-separated list of the words that mean YES at a
#. "[y/N]" prompt in your language, lower case, shortest first. English
#. "y" and "yes" are always accepted as well — do not remove them, and do
#. not translate them. German: "j ja y yes". French: "o oui y yes".
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-i18n.sh:160
msgid "y yes"
msgstr "o oui y yes"

#. TRANSLATORS: the "remove anytime" line is a COMMAND typed verbatim into a
#. terminal — leave `sudo rm -f /usr/local/bin/ollama` exactly as it is.
#. "Ollama" is a product name.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-ai:14
msgid ""
"Dagric local AI setup\n"
"=======================\n"
"This installs Ollama, a local large-language-model runner:\n"
"  * models run entirely on this computer (GPU-accelerated when available)\n"
"  * works offline; nothing is sent anywhere\n"
"  * remove anytime:  sudo rm -f /usr/local/bin/ollama\n"
msgstr ""
"Configuration de l'IA locale Dagric\n"
"=======================\n"
"Ceci installe Ollama, un moteur local de grands modèles de langage :\n"
"  * les modèles tournent entièrement sur cet ordinateur (accélérés par le "
"GPU si possible)\n"
"  * fonctionne hors ligne ; rien n'est envoyé nulle part\n"
"  * suppression à tout moment :  sudo rm -f /usr/local/bin/ollama\n"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-ai:21
msgid "Install Ollama from https://ollama.com? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Ollama depuis https://ollama.com ? [o/N]"

#. TRANSLATORS: "ollama run llama3.2" is a command typed verbatim.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-ai:27
msgid "Done. Try:  ollama run llama3.2"
msgstr "Terminé. Essayez :  ollama run llama3.2"

