msgstr "Autres écrans, résolution et taux de rafraîchissement"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-driver-offer:36
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-hub:25
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:17
msgid "Press Enter to close..."
msgstr "Appuyez sur Entrée pour fermer..."

#. TRANSLATORS: 'Finish Setup' is the launcher entry the owner searches for —
#. use the same words as the Name= of dagric-setup.desktop in your language.
#. 'sudo dagric-drivers' is a command typed verbatim; do not translate it.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-driver-offer:41
msgid "NVIDIA graphics detected"
msgstr "Carte graphique NVIDIA détectée"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-driver-offer:42
msgid ""
"Dagric found an NVIDIA graphics card.\n"
"\n"
"Install the NVIDIA proprietary driver now for the best performance and\n"
"battery life?\n"
"\n"
"You can always do this later — search 'Finish Setup' in the launcher, or\n"
"run 'sudo dagric-drivers' in a terminal."
msgstr ""
"Dagric a trouvé une carte graphique NVIDIA.\n"
"\n"
"Installer maintenant le pilote propriétaire NVIDIA, pour de meilleures "
"performances\n"
"et une meilleure autonomie ?\n"
"\n"
"Vous pourrez toujours le faire plus tard — cherchez « Terminer la "
"configuration »\n"
"dans le menu, ou lancez « sudo dagric-drivers » dans un terminal."

#. TRANSLATORS: "sudo dagric-drivers" is a command typed verbatim.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:16
msgid "Run with sudo: sudo dagric-drivers"
msgstr "À lancer avec sudo : sudo dagric-drivers"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:20
msgid "Dagric driver check"
msgstr "Vérification des pilotes Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:23
msgid "NVIDIA GPU detected:"
msgstr "Carte graphique NVIDIA détectée :"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:26
msgid "Install NVIDIA's proprietary driver from the system's non-free repository? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer le pilote propriétaire NVIDIA depuis le dépôt non-free du système ? [o/N]"

#. TRANSLATORS: this warns that skipping the enrollment step
#. leaves the machine at a BLACK SCREEN after reboot. Keep that
#. consequence explicit — it is the whole point of the notice.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:42
msgid ""
"NOTE: Secure Boot is ON. The NVIDIA driver builds a kernel\n"
"module that must be signed and enrolled, or it won't load\n"
"(black screen). Dagric will set up the signing key and ask\n"
"you to enroll it — you'll finish that at the next reboot."
msgstr ""
"REMARQUE : le Secure Boot est ACTIVÉ. Le pilote NVIDIA construit un\n"
"module noyau qui doit être signé et enregistré, sinon il ne se chargera\n"
"pas (écran noir). Dagric va préparer la clé de signature et vous demander\n"
"de l'enregistrer — vous terminerez cela au prochain redémarrage."

#. TRANSLATORS: 'MOK Management', 'Enroll MOK' and 'Continue' are
#. the literal words on the blue firmware screen at the next
#. boot. That screen is ENGLISH ONLY and cannot be translated, so
#. these three must stay in English or the owner will hunt for a
#. button that is not there. Everything around them should be
#. translated.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:66
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT — finish Secure Boot enrollment:\n"
"  1. Reboot now.\n"
"  2. At the blue 'MOK Management' screen, choose\n"
"     'Enroll MOK' -> 'Continue' and enter the password\n"
"     you were just asked for.\n"
"  3. The system boots into the NVIDIA driver.\n"
"If you skip this, the driver won't load and you'll fall\n"
"back to the open-source driver. You can re-run this anytime."
msgstr ""
"IMPORTANT — terminez l'enregistrement Secure Boot :\n"
"  1. Redémarrez maintenant.\n"
"  2. Sur l'écran bleu « MOK Management », choisissez\n"
"     « Enroll MOK » -> « Continue » et saisissez le mot de passe\n"
"     qui vient de vous être demandé.\n"
"  3. Le système démarre avec le pilote NVIDIA.\n"
"Si vous sautez cette étape, le pilote ne se chargera pas et vous\n"
"reviendrez au pilote libre. Vous pouvez relancer ceci à tout moment."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:75
msgid "Done. Reboot to switch to the NVIDIA driver."
msgstr "Terminé. Redémarrez pour passer au pilote NVIDIA."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:81
msgid ""
"No NVIDIA GPU found. AMD and Intel graphics use the built-in\n"
"open-source drivers — nothing to install."
msgstr ""
"Aucune carte NVIDIA trouvée. Les cartes AMD et Intel utilisent les pilotes\n"
"libres intégrés — il n'y a rien à installer."

