#. TRANSLATORS: "Windows is only ever READ — nothing there is changed"
#. is the product's central promise, said to somebody who is afraid of
#. losing the Windows install they may still need. Keep the negation and
#. keep the emphasis on READ.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:775
msgid ""
"A Windows drive was found on this PC.\n"
"\n"
"Bring your Documents, Pictures, Music, Videos and browser bookmarks\n"
"across now? Windows is only ever READ — nothing there is changed."
msgstr ""
"Un disque Windows a été trouvé sur ce PC.\n"
"\n"
"Récupérer maintenant vos Documents, Images, Musique, Vidéos et vos favoris "
"de\n"
"navigateur ? Windows est uniquement LU — rien n'y est modifié."

#. TRANSLATORS: "Dagric Hub", "Dagric Manual" and "Set Up Dagric" are the
#. names the owner has to TYPE into the launcher to find these things, so
#. they must match the Name= of dagric-hub.desktop, dagric-manual.desktop
#. and dagric-firstrun.desktop in your language, exactly. "Dagric Hub" is
#. not translated at all — it is a product name.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:789
msgid ""
"You're set up.\n"
"\n"
"Everything else lives in the Dagric Hub — press the launcher and type\n"
"\"Dagric Hub\". The offline User Guide is in there, and so is the\n"
"Dagric Manual: a page on every app on this computer and what it\n"
"replaced on Windows.\n"
"\n"
"To see this again, open \"Set Up Dagric\" from the launcher."
msgstr ""
"Vous êtes prêt.\n"
"\n"
"Tout le reste se trouve dans le Dagric Hub — ouvrez le menu et tapez\n"
"« Dagric Hub ». Le guide de l'utilisateur hors ligne s'y trouve, ainsi que "
"le\n"
"Manuel Dagric : une page par application de cet ordinateur et ce qu'elle "
"remplace\n"
"sous Windows.\n"
"\n"
"Pour revoir ceci, ouvrez « Configurer Dagric » depuis le menu."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:1082
msgid "Dagric is set up. Everything else lives in the Dagric Hub."
msgstr "Dagric est configuré. Tout le reste se trouve dans le Dagric Hub."

#. TRANSLATORS: "wine setup.exe" and "dagric-get-steam" are commands typed
#. verbatim. Wine, winetricks, gamemode, mangohud, Vulkan, Proton, Proton-GE,
#. Steam and GloriousEggroll are product names — leave them all as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:13
msgid ""
"Dagric gaming setup\n"
"=====================\n"
"Already preinstalled on Dagric Pro:\n"
"  * Wine + winetricks       run Windows apps:  wine setup.exe\n"
"  * gamemode + mangohud     performance governor + FPS overlay\n"
"  * 32-bit Vulkan           ready for Proton's Windows games\n"
"\n"
"Steam itself is NEVER bundled (it is proprietary) — install it any time\n"
"with one click from the Dagric Hub, or run:  dagric-get-steam\n"
"\n"
"This helper adds Proton-GE (GloriousEggroll's community Proton with\n"
"extra media codecs and game-specific fixes) for a Steam you've installed."
msgstr ""
"Configuration jeux de Dagric\n"
"=====================\n"
"Déjà préinstallé sur Dagric Pro :\n"
"  * Wine + winetricks       exécuter des applis Windows :  wine setup.exe\n"
"  * gamemode + mangohud     régulateur de performance + affichage des FPS\n"
"  * Vulkan 32 bits          prêt pour les jeux Windows via Proton\n"
"\n"
"Steam lui-même n'est JAMAIS fourni (il est propriétaire) — installez-le "
"quand vous\n"
"voulez en un clic depuis le Dagric Hub, ou lancez :  dagric-get-steam\n"
"\n"
"Cet assistant ajoute Proton-GE (le Proton communautaire de GloriousEggroll, "
"avec des\n"
"codecs média supplémentaires et des correctifs par jeu) pour un Steam déjà "
"installé."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:25
msgid "Download the latest Proton-GE from GitHub? [y/N]"
msgstr "Télécharger le dernier Proton-GE depuis GitHub ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:36
msgid "Steam data dir not found. Launch Steam once first, then re-run this."
msgstr ""
"Le dossier de données de Steam est introuvable. Lancez Steam une fois, puis "
"relancez ceci."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:43
msgid "Could not find the latest release (offline?). Try again later."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de trouver la dernière version (hors ligne ?). Réessayez plus "
"tard."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:46
#, sh-format
msgid "Downloading: $URL"
msgstr "Téléchargement : $URL"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:49
#, sh-format
msgid "Installed to $DEST"
msgstr "Installé dans $DEST"

#. TRANSLATORS: "Settings", "Compatibility" and "Properties" are Steam's own
#. menu labels — use the words Steam shows in your language, if you know them.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-gaming:52
msgid ""
"In Steam: Settings > Compatibility > enable, then pick the GE-Proton\n"
"version per game under Properties > Compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Dans Steam : Paramètres > Compatibilité > activer, puis choisir la version\n"
"GE-Proton par jeu dans Propriétés > Compatibilité."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:18
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Bottles (run Windows apps)\n"
"\n"
"Bottles is a free, open-source app that runs Windows programs and games on\n"
"Linux inside self-contained \"bottles\", tuned per app for the best chance "
"of\n"
"working. It's the easy way to bring a Windows app across. Installs from "
"Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Bottles (exécuter des programmes Windows)\n"
"\n"
"Bottles est un logiciel libre et gratuit qui exécute les programmes et les "
"jeux\n"
"Windows sous Linux dans des « bottles » indépendantes, réglées application "
"par\n"
"application pour maximiser les chances que cela fonctionne. C'est la manière "
"simple\n"
"d'emporter une application Windows avec vous. Installation depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:24
msgid "Install Bottles now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Bottles maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:27
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:21
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:18
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:21
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:20
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:23
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:21
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:28
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:20
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:39
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-vm:46
msgid "No changes made."
msgstr "Aucune modification n'a été faite."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:34
msgid "Bottles installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Bottles est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-bottles:36
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:30
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:27
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:30
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:31
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:32
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:30
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:29
msgid "Install did not complete. Check your network and try again."
msgstr ""
"L'installation ne s'est pas terminée. Vérifiez votre connexion réseau et "
"réessayez."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Cryptomator (encrypt before the cloud)\n"
"\n"
"Cryptomator creates encrypted vaults that live inside your normal cloud\n"
"folders. Your files are encrypted on your machine first, so Google, "
"Dropbox,\n"
"or anyone else only ever stores scrambled data. You hold the only key.\n"
"From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Cryptomator (chiffrer avant le cloud)\n"
"\n"
"Cryptomator crée des coffres chiffrés qui vivent à l'intérieur de vos "
"dossiers cloud\n"
"habituels. Vos fichiers sont chiffrés sur votre machine d'abord, si bien que "
"Google,\n"
"Dropbox ou n'importe qui d'autre ne stocke jamais que des données "
"brouillées. Vous\n"
"seul détenez la clé.\n"
"Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:18
msgid "Install Cryptomator now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Cryptomator maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-cryptomator:28
msgid "Cryptomator installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Cryptomator est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:10
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Heroic Games Launcher\n"
"\n"
"Heroic is a free, open-source launcher for your Epic Games, GOG, and Amazon\n"
"Prime Gaming libraries, with Proton/Wine built in. It installs from Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Heroic Games Launcher\n"
"\n"
"Heroic est un lanceur libre et gratuit pour vos bibliothèques Epic Games, "
"GOG et\n"
"Amazon Prime Gaming, avec Proton/Wine intégré. Il s'installe depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:15
msgid "Install Heroic now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Heroic maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-heroic:25
msgid "Heroic installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Heroic est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Joplin (notes that stay yours)\n"
"\n"
"Joplin keeps notes, notebooks, and to-dos in plain Markdown on YOUR disk.\n"
"No account required, works fully offline, and if you ever want sync it's\n"
"end-to-end encrypted — to a folder, Syncthing, or your own server.\n"
"The private alternative to OneNote and Notion. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Joplin (des notes qui restent les vôtres)\n"
"\n"
"Joplin garde vos notes, carnets et tâches en Markdown simple sur VOTRE "
"disque.\n"
"Aucun compte requis, fonctionne entièrement hors ligne, et si un jour vous "
"voulez\n"
"la synchronisation, elle est chiffrée de bout en bout — vers un dossier, "
"Syncthing\n"
"ou votre propre serveur.\n"
"L'alternative privée à OneNote et Notion. Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:18
msgid "Install Joplin now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Joplin maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-joplin:28
msgid "Joplin installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Joplin est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install LocalSend (share files, privately)\n"
"\n"
"LocalSend sends files and messages straight between your devices on the "
"same\n"
"network — phone, laptop, desktop — with no account, no cloud, and nothing\n"
"leaving your network. It's the private alternative to AirDrop. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer LocalSend (partager des fichiers, en privé)\n"
"\n"
"LocalSend envoie fichiers et messages directement entre vos appareils sur le "
"même\n"
"réseau — téléphone, portable, ordinateur de bureau — sans compte, sans "
"cloud, et\n"
"rien ne sort de votre réseau. L'alternative privée à AirDrop. Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:17
msgid "Install LocalSend now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer LocalSend maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:28
msgid "LocalSend installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "LocalSend est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-localsend:29
msgid "Install it on your phone too (same name) and they'll find each other."
msgstr ""
"Installez-le aussi sur votre téléphone (même nom) et les appareils se "
"trouveront tout seuls."

#. TRANSLATORS: "ONLYOFFICE", "LibreOffice", "Word", "Excel", "PowerPoint" and
#. "Flathub" are product names — leave them exactly as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:13
msgid ""
"Dagric — install ONLYOFFICE (the familiar Office look)\n"
"\n"
"ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors is an open-source office suite with the ribbon\n"
"layout Microsoft Office users already know, and excellent compatibility\n"
"with Word/Excel/PowerPoint files. It runs alongside LibreOffice — keep\n"
"whichever feels right (or both). From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer ONLYOFFICE (l'apparence Office familière)\n"
"\n"
"ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors est une suite bureautique libre avec le ruban que "
"les\n"
"utilisateurs de Microsoft Office connaissent déjà, et une excellente "
"compatibilité\n"
"avec les fichiers Word/Excel/PowerPoint. Elle cohabite avec LibreOffice — "
"gardez\n"
"celle qui vous convient (ou les deux). Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:20
msgid "Install ONLYOFFICE now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer ONLYOFFICE maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-onlyoffice:30
msgid "ONLYOFFICE installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "ONLYOFFICE est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#. TRANSLATORS: "ProtonUp-Qt", "Proton-GE", "Wine-GE", "Steam", "Lutris" and
#. "Flathub" are product names — leave them exactly as they are.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:12
msgid ""
"Dagric — install ProtonUp-Qt\n"
"\n"
"ProtonUp-Qt is a free, open-source app for installing and switching between\n"
"Proton-GE and Wine-GE versions for Steam and Lutris — no terminal needed.\n"
"It installs from Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer ProtonUp-Qt\n"
"\n"
"ProtonUp-Qt est un logiciel libre et gratuit pour installer les versions "
"Proton-GE\n"
"et Wine-GE de Steam et Lutris et passer de l'une à l'autre — sans terminal.\n"
"Il s'installe depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:18
msgid "Install ProtonUp-Qt now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer ProtonUp-Qt maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-protonup:28
msgid "ProtonUp-Qt installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "ProtonUp-Qt est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#. TRANSLATORS: the four indented lines are COMMANDS the owner types verbatim
#. into a terminal — cd, unzip, sudo and the file names must not be translated
#. or reflowed, or the instructions stop working. The last paragraph is a
#. LICENCE statement (Blackmagic forbids redistribution, which is why Dagric
#. does not bundle Resolve); keep that meaning exact. "DaVinci Resolve",
#. "Blackmagic", "NVIDIA" and "Dagric" are names.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-resolve:17
msgid ""
"DaVinci Resolve on Dagric OS\n"
"==============================\n"
"1. Visit  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/products/davinciresolve\n"
"   (opening it in your browser now if possible...)\n"
"2. Click \"Free Download\", pick the Linux version, and register.\n"
"3. Unzip the download, then run the installer:\n"
"       cd ~/Downloads\n"
"       unzip DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.zip\n"
"       sudo ./DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.run\n"
"4. NVIDIA users: run  sudo dagric-drivers  first — Resolve on Linux\n"
"   performs best with the proprietary driver.\n"
"\n"
"Why isn't it preinstalled? Blackmagic's license forbids redistribution.\n"
"Any OS that bundles it is violating that license — Dagric won't."
msgstr ""
"DaVinci Resolve sous Dagric OS\n"
"==============================\n"
"1. Rendez-vous sur  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/products/"
"davinciresolve\n"
"   (ouverture dans votre navigateur maintenant si possible...)\n"
"2. Cliquez sur « Free Download », choisissez la version Linux et inscrivez-"
"vous.\n"
"3. Décompressez le téléchargement, puis lancez l'installateur :\n"
"       cd ~/Downloads\n"
"       unzip DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.zip\n"
"       sudo ./DaVinci_Resolve_*_Linux.run\n"
"4. Utilisateurs NVIDIA : lancez d'abord  sudo dagric-drivers  — sous Linux,\n"
"   Resolve donne le meilleur avec le pilote propriétaire.\n"
"\n"
"Pourquoi n'est-il pas préinstallé ? La licence de Blackmagic interdit la\n"
"redistribution. Tout système qui l'inclut viole cette licence — pas Dagric."

#. TRANSLATORS: this paragraph explains a LICENCE position — Dagric does not
#. bundle Steam because Valve's licence forbids it. Keep that meaning exact;
#. it is the reason the helper exists. "Steam" and "Valve" are product names.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:16
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Steam\n"
"\n"
"Steam is Valve's proprietary game store and launcher. Dagric doesn't ship "
"it\n"
"preinstalled (its licence forbids anyone bundling it), but installing it is "
"one\n"
"step. Everything it depends on is already set up on Dagric Pro.\n"
"\n"
"You'll be asked for your administrator password, then Steam downloads and\n"
"installs. Afterwards, launch \"Steam\" from the application launcher."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Steam\n"
"\n"
"Steam est la boutique et le lanceur de jeux propriétaires de Valve. Dagric "
"ne le\n"
"livre pas préinstallé (sa licence interdit à quiconque de l'inclure), mais\n"
"l'installer ne prend qu'une étape. Tout ce dont il dépend est déjà en place "
"sur\n"
"Dagric Pro.\n"
"\n"
"Votre mot de passe administrateur vous sera demandé, puis Steam se "
"télécharge et\n"
"s'installe. Ensuite, lancez « Steam » depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:25
msgid "Install Steam now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Steam maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:38
msgid ""
"Steam installed. Launch it from the application launcher; on first\n"
"run it finishes updating itself."
msgstr ""
"Steam est installé. Lancez-le depuis le menu des applications ; au premier\n"
"démarrage, il termine sa mise à jour."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-steam:45
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"Steam installation did not complete (exit $RC). You can retry from\n"
"the Dagric Hub, or check your network connection."
msgstr ""
"L'installation de Steam ne s'est pas terminée (code de sortie $RC). Vous "
"pouvez\n"
"réessayer depuis le Dagric Hub ou vérifier votre connexion réseau."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:11
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Upscayl (AI image upscaler, offline)\n"
"\n"
"Upscayl enlarges and sharpens photos and artwork using AI that runs locally "
"on\n"
"your machine — nothing is uploaded. Great for rescuing small or old images.\n"
"A capable GPU helps but isn't required. From Flathub."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Upscayl (agrandissement d'images par IA, hors ligne)\n"
"\n"
"Upscayl agrandit et affine photos et illustrations avec une IA qui tourne "
"localement\n"
"sur votre machine — rien n'est envoyé sur Internet. Parfait pour sauver de "
"petites\n"
"ou vieilles images. Une bonne carte graphique aide mais n'est pas "
"indispensable.\n"
"Depuis Flathub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:17
msgid "Install Upscayl now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Upscayl maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-upscayl:27
msgid "Upscayl installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Upscayl est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#. TRANSLATORS: the two bullet points are a PRIVACY disclosure — Variety can
#. fetch wallpapers from third-party websites, and that is why Dagric does not
#. preinstall it. Keep both the fact and the "OFF until you enable it" caveat.
#. "Slideshow" and "Configure Desktop and Wallpaper" are labels the owner has
#. to find in Plasma, so use the wording Plasma itself uses in your language.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:20
msgid ""
"Dagric — install Variety (automatic wallpaper changer)\n"
"\n"
"Variety changes your wallpaper on a schedule, from your own folders and,\n"
"if you switch it on, from online collections. It adds a tray icon for\n"
"skipping, pausing and favouriting the current image.\n"
"\n"
"Two things worth knowing before you install:\n"
"  * Variety can download wallpapers from third-party websites. That is\n"
"    OFF until you enable a source, but it is why Dagric doesn't preinstall "
"it.\n"
"  * If you only want a rotating slideshow of your OWN pictures, you don't\n"
"    need this at all — right-click the desktop, Configure Desktop and\n"
"    Wallpaper, and choose \"Slideshow\".\n"
"\n"
"Installed from the system's own repositories (GPL-3, open source), about 25 MB\n"
"its dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Dagric — installer Variety (changement automatique de fond d'écran)\n"
"\n"
"Variety change votre fond d'écran selon un horaire, depuis vos propres "
"dossiers et,\n"
"si vous l'activez, depuis des collections en ligne. Il ajoute une icône dans "
"la\n"
"zone de notification pour passer, mettre en pause ou mettre en favori "
"l'image en cours.\n"
"\n"
"Deux choses à savoir avant d'installer :\n"
"  * Variety peut télécharger des fonds d'écran depuis des sites tiers. "
"C'est\n"
"    DÉSACTIVÉ tant que vous n'activez pas une source, mais c'est la raison "
"pour\n"
"    laquelle Dagric ne le préinstalle pas.\n"
"  * Si vous voulez seulement un diaporama de VOS propres images, vous n'en "
"avez\n"
"    pas besoin du tout — clic droit sur le bureau, « Configurer le bureau et "
"le\n"
"    fond d'écran », puis choisissez « Diaporama ».\n"
"\n"
"Installé depuis les dépôts du système (GPL-3, logiciel libre), environ 25 Mo "
"avec\n"
"ses dépendances."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:36
msgid "Install Variety now? [y/N]"
msgstr "Installer Variety maintenant ? [o/N]"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:45
msgid "Variety installed — launch it from the application launcher."
msgstr "Variety est installé — lancez-le depuis le menu des applications."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:46
msgid "It starts in the system tray; right-click the icon for options."
msgstr ""
"Il démarre dans la zone de notification ; clic droit sur l'icône pour les "
"options."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:49
msgid "Install did not complete (administrator access is required)."
msgstr ""
"L'installation ne s'est pas terminée (un accès administrateur est "
"nécessaire)."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-get-variety:50
msgid "You can try again from the Dagric Hub."
msgstr "Vous pouvez réessayer depuis le Dagric Hub."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-guide:23
msgid "The Dagric user guide is not installed."
msgstr "Le guide de l'utilisateur Dagric n'est pas installé."

#. TRANSLATORS: a section heading in the Dagric Hub menu. The ── dashes are
#. decoration that pads the row to a comfortable width; re-cut them to whatever
#. length your words need. The row width is not load-bearing.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-hub:47
msgid "──  Get started  ──────────────────"
msgstr "──  Pour commencer  ───────────────"

#. TRANSLATORS: section heading — see the note on "Get started". Decoration only.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-hub:49
msgid "──  Appearance  ───────────────────"
msgstr "──  Apparence  ────────────────────"

#. TRANSLATORS: section heading — see the note on "Get started". Decoration only.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-hub:51
msgid "──  System  ───────────────────────"
msgstr "──  Système  ──────────────────────"

#. TRANSLATORS: section heading — see the note on "Get started". Decoration only.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-hub:53
msgid "──  Add more apps  ────────────────"
msgstr "──  Ajouter des applis  ───────────"

#. TRANSLATORS: Hub row, live USB only. This is shown BEFORE anything is
